## Scope evidence

- Provider: Threads, Instagram, Facebook, X, YouTube, TikTok, 6/6.
- Surface: Threads Post, Instagram Feed/Reels, Facebook Page Feed/Reels, X Post, YouTube Shorts, TikTok Post, 8/8.
- Capability: PRD canonical IDs 12/12.
- 공통 탭: 6 providers × `Queue / Editor / Analytics / Growth / Popular / Settings`, 36/36, hidden 0.
- Settings: 6 providers × 9 groups, 54/54. 각 group은 A/R/N, 고객 상태, 이유, evidence, enable 조건, 조치 CTA detail pane을 가진다.
- Analytics/Growth/Popular: 6×3 contract 18/18, S/R/U와 표본 0/2/3, 가짜 0 없음.
- Global Settings와 Platform Settings: summary/detail 역할 분리, 같은 account truth.
- Instagram Feed/Reels, Facebook Feed/Reels: surface switcher, Editor fields, content/schedule readiness가 분리됐다.
- Current readiness: Threads/Instagram 운영 관찰과 connection hard stop, Facebook/X/YouTube/TikTok credential/review/E2E gap을 숨기지 않는다.
- Target contract: 6 provider 모두 generation, edit, review, Now/Schedule, Queue, processing, Result, recovery click path가 있다.

