## Benchmark evidence

1. Meta Threads/Instagram/Facebook official Postman workspaces
   - 차용: container, publish, processing, insights의 lifecycle.
   - 변경: provider 수락을 성공으로 쓰지 않고 external ID/link/identity를 Result Group 종료조건으로 둠.
   - https://www.postman.com/meta/threads/overview
   - https://www.postman.com/meta/instagram/overview
   - https://www.postman.com/meta/facebook/overview
   - https://www.postman.com/meta/facebook/folder/simabyk/reels-publishing
2. X official Media and Metrics
   - 차용: upload→media_id→post, auth별 metric 차이.
   - 변경: current media gap과 pay-per-use/review를 readiness로 노출.
   - https://docs.x.com/x-api/media/introduction
   - https://docs.x.com/x-api/fundamentals/metrics
3. YouTube Videos and processingDetails
   - 차용: unverified private, publishAt 조건, processing terminal.
   - 변경: Shorts의 privacy/audience/synthetic disclosure를 Final Review 필수값으로 둠.
   - https://developers.google.com/youtube/v3/docs/videos
   - https://developers.google.com/youtube/v3/guides/implementation/videos
4. TikTok Direct Post and Get Post Status
   - 차용: creator info, explicit consent, audit, moderation, publish status.
   - 변경: creator/privacy/AI/commercial consent를 surface Editor와 Final Review에 배치.
   - https://developers.tiktok.com/doc/content-posting-api-reference-direct-post
   - https://developers.tiktok.com/doc/content-posting-api-reference-get-video-status
5. Buffer and Postiz
   - 차용: network별 customize, draft/now/schedule의 명시적 분리.
   - 변경: one source의 12 variant를 독립 편집하고 partial success를 재발행하지 않음.
   - https://support.buffer.com/article/642-scheduling-posts
   - https://docs.postiz.com/public-api/posts/create
   - https://docs.postiz.com/cli/managing-posts

구조화 raw evidence는 `docs/prototype/openclaw-auto-osmu-benchmark-evidence-v5-gpt-codex.jsonl`에 있다.

